  "description_original": "Izdaje se luksuzan, potpuno renoviran stan od 64.0 m² u srcu Tivta, u prestižnom centru na Trgu magnolija.\nSmješten na 1.spratu, ovaj prozracan jednosoban stan nudi izuzetan komfor i eleganciju. Potpuno je opremljen i pazljivo dizajniran enterijer sa novim modernim namještajem i aparatima. Raspolaže prostranim hodnikom, udobnom spavaćom sobom, elegantnim kupatilom, moderno uređenom kuhinjom i trpezarijom. Stan ima veliku terasu, pravu rijetkost na trzistu, idealnu za uzivanje, druzenje i stvaranje dodatnog prostora za boravak na otvorenom.\nStan je opremljen klimatizacijom za prijatan boravak tokom cijele godine. Ovo je idealna prilika za one koji traže kvalitetan, funkcionalan i odmah useljiv dom u centru grada.\n\nA luxurious, completely renovated 64.0 m² apartment is for rent in the heart of Tivat, in the prestigious center on Magnolia Square.\nLocated on the 1st floor, this airy one-bedroom apartment offers exceptional comfort and elegance. It is fully equipped and carefully designed interior with new modern furniture and appliances. It has a spacious hallway, comfortable bedroom, elegant bathroom, modern kitchen and dining room. The apartment has a large terrace, a real rarity on the market, ideal for enjoying, socializing and creating additional space for outdoor living.\nThe apartment is equipped with air conditioning for a pleasant stay throughout the year. This is an ideal opportunity for those looking for a quality, functional and immediately move-in home in the city center.",
